        <h2>Built for the<br/>complex work.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We focus on the projects homeowners plan most — kitchens, bathrooms and ADUs — with framing, foundation and engineering experience behind every job.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid home-services">
      <a class="service service-link" href="/kitchen-remodeling/">
        <div class="service">
          <span class="num">REMODELING</span><span class="symbol">✦</span>
          <h3>Kitchen Remodels</h3>
          <p>Layout changes, cabinetry, counters, flooring and full kitchen renovations.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="service-cta">Learn more about kitchens</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service service-link" href="/bathroom-remodeling/">
        <div class="service">
          <span class="num">REMODELING</span><span class="symbol">◇</span>
          <h3>Bathroom Remodels</h3>
          <p>Showers, tile, vanities and complete primary and guest bath renovations.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="service-cta">Learn more about bathrooms</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service service-link" href="/adus-additions/">
        <div class="service">
          <span class="num">NEW SPACE</span><span class="symbol">⌂</span>
          <h3>ADUs &amp; Additions</h3>
          <p>Accessory dwelling units, garage conversions and home additions, from site coordination to finish.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="service-cta">Learn more about ADUs</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service service-link" href="/contact/">
        <div class="service">
          <span class="num">YOUR NEXT PROJECT</span>
          <h3>Let's Build.</h3>
          <p>Tell us about your project and get a free consult and written estimate.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="service-cta">Request an estimate</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

